        "tags": [
          "backup"
        ],
        "summary": "List Targets",
        "description": "Every configured destination, in ``config.yaml`` order, with how\nits last run went \u2014 and the schedule, when there is one (issue\n#438: \"surfaced in the dashboard\").",
